</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>More than jewels I’ve seen before,</l><l>Charming, mesmerizing;</l><l>As I’m dazzled, drawn e’en more,</l><l>Joy as dawn is rising.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Stone that ne’er shall age or change,</l><l>My fresh love restoring;</l><l>Daily I anticipate</l><l>Facets new each morning!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Jesus, Thou art loveliest!</l><l>Precious, matchless treasure!</l><l>Shine in Thine exquisiteness,</l><l>Clear and bright forever!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
